   */
  durationMs?: number,
}): Promise<unknown>"},{"path":"tools.argent["gesture-swipe"]","description":"Execute a smooth swipe / drag touch gesture between two points on the device (iOS simulator or physical device, or Android emulator). All from/to positions are fractions of screen width/height (not pixels), same as gesture-tap.
Generates interpolated Move events for a natural feel (~60fps).
